{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Hell, everything is a gambit.</h2><br><strong>Hell Dice Gambit</strong> is a strategic horror roguelike where your fate hangs on every roll. Trapped in an infernal arena, you must risk your life with four cursed dice \u2014 each face carved with swords, shields, stars, skulls, crowns, and chance itself.<br><br><i>Roll. Read the hand. Risk everything.</i><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Form dice combinations</strong> using poker-style hands to deal damage, raise barriers, curse your enemy, or claim items. Every roll forces a decision: play it safe, or commit fully to a devastating combo?<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Outlast your opponent</strong> in turn-based deathmatches where timing, item management, and calculated risks determine who survives. Your enemy plays by the same rules \u2014 and they're stacking their deck too.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Stack your deck.</strong> After each victory, choose from relics that bend fate, specialized dice that shift the odds, and pills that amplify your hands. Choose wisely \u2014 your opponent draws from the same pool.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dice-poker combat</strong> \u2014 20+ unique combinations<br></li><li> <strong>50+ rewards</strong> \u2014 dice, relics, and pills that stack and chain into devastating synergies<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic items &amp; curses</strong> to outplay your foe<br></li><li> <strong>Roguelike progression</strong> where every risk compounds<br></li><li> <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong> \u2014 death is not an escape</li></ul><br><i>How long can you keep winning before Hell collects?</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964420/db76612fdd623e4d5d9722ef74a0a32374fdb31c.jpg"},{"name":"Easy Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3964420/6a9b1161e44fb06486bb3848ebac72f2022ce98b.j